<title>UK: LME copper ekes out fresh one-year high in 1st rin.</title>
<headline>LME copper ekes out fresh one-year high in 1st rin.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Hits fresh one-year high of $2,540, $1 up from previous peak. Cash/threes backwardation slightly narrower at $64/7.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Modestly weaker below $1,620, but off lows.</p>
<p>ZINC - Also softer, but rebounds off lows.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Slightly firmer, above $7,300.</p>
<p>LEAD - Touch weaker. TIN - Unchanged.</p>
</text>
